repository-code: "https://github.com/TheSmashingPumpkinPies/KineIMU-Shoulder"
abstract: >-
  A dual-IMU research framework for quantitative shoulder movement analysis,
  with tested dual-USB acquisition, explicit quaternion processing and
  hardware-free synthetic replay. Human and clinical accuracy are unvalidated.
keywords:
  - shoulder
  - humerothoracic movement
  - inertial measurement unit
  - reproducible research
